WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.009
In about two minutes, you will set up a contest your way, with judges and a prize.

00:00:05.954 --> 00:00:09.286
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.158 --> 00:00:13.580
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.070
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.416
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:21.374
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.374 --> 00:00:22.025
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.066
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:29.283
See the three dots?

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:29.831
Tap them.

00:00:31.435 --> 00:00:33.014
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:34.776 --> 00:00:35.959
Three choices.

00:00:35.959 --> 00:00:37.064
Tap A contest.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.176
Name your contest.

00:00:40.176 --> 00:00:41.988
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:00:44.981 --> 00:00:46.122
Who is running it?

00:00:46.122 --> 00:00:48.824
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:00:51.883 --> 00:00:54.459
This welcome message is already written.

00:00:54.459 --> 00:00:55.842
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:00:57.644 --> 00:00:59.371
A website is optional.

00:00:59.371 --> 00:01:01.023
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.227
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:05.227 --> 00:01:05.816
Tap Next.

00:01:07.892 --> 00:01:09.857
Choose Customize everything.

00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:10.806
Then tap Next.

00:01:13.369 --> 00:01:15.036
Add your own category.

00:01:15.036 --> 00:01:16.051
Then tap Next.

00:01:19.472 --> 00:01:20.447
Who can vote?

00:01:20.447 --> 00:01:22.606
We choose Everyone and judges.

00:01:22.606 --> 00:01:23.582
Then tap Next.

00:01:26.126 --> 00:01:29.372
Add your judges, one email on each line.

00:01:29.372 --> 00:01:30.480
Then tap Next.

00:01:33.227 --> 00:01:34.377
Choose score.

00:01:34.377 --> 00:01:35.526
Then tap Next.

00:01:38.084 --> 00:01:39.399
Keep the default.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.057
Tap Next.

00:01:42.224 --> 00:01:43.540
Keep the default.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.198
Tap Next.

00:01:46.366 --> 00:01:47.682
Keep the default.

00:01:47.682 --> 00:01:48.340
Tap Next.

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:51.375
Add a prize.

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.659
We give each winner the same one.

00:01:53.659 --> 00:01:54.600
Then tap Next.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.996
Your rules are written.

00:01:59.996 --> 00:02:00.595
Tap Next.

00:02:02.763 --> 00:02:05.399
Check everything, and tap Create contest.

00:02:07.856 --> 00:02:09.505
Your contest is live!

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:11.153
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:17.468
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:21.178
Next up: Share your contest.
